    "interpretation": "Designed initial roots and susceptibility envelope, followed by coupled Julia harmonic growth, heat diffusion, persistent exposure and conservative feedstock/mineral exchange. Electrical roots remain separate; the saved mineral field forms one six-face-connected component touching all roots at the chosen threshold. Peak heating is held fixed with a broader Gaussian, increasing integrated source input 8.726847 times versus The shared weather; this is intentionally a hotter composition, not an equal-energy comparison. Glass, copper and cyan emission are chosen optical mappings. Degree-two paths receive two subvoxel corner-softening passes preserving graph connectivity. No solved luminescence, animated deformation, interpolation or reverse-time padding."
